    readTime: '4 min',
    category: 'Open Source',
    url: 'https://pt.linkedin.com/posts/rinel-benjamim_laravel-docker-postgresql-activity-7361301966611795968-eTC5',
  },
  {
    title: 'Relacionamentos Polimórficos no Laravel com Eloquent ORM',
